1
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:29,370
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,950
[Episode 14]

3
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,350
Eat it.

4
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,350
Maybe you can get a chance

5
00:00:57,350 --> 00:00:59,150
to be together forever.

6
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,310
Do you

7
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:13,710
recognize me?

8
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,310
No.

9
00:01:23,070 --> 00:01:23,920
You look very much like

10
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,840
an old friend who was kind to me.

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,509
There's something ancient
about your scent,

12
00:01:36,509 --> 00:01:38,590
like wood that's been buried underground

13
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:39,920
for thousands of years.

14
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:42,560
No one else smells like that.

15
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:47,430
[Memorial Tablet of Chen Gensheng]

16
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:50,229
Granny Chen,

17
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,680
is she your mother?

18
00:01:56,110 --> 00:01:57,390
Mother?

19
00:01:58,259 --> 00:02:01,260
She watered and took care of me.

20
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:05,120
Does that make her a mother?

21
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:13,790
Your family has passed away.

22
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:16,630
I can't bring them back to life.

23
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,190
But I promise,

24
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:21,800
from now on,

25
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,890
you'll want for nothing

26
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:25,870
and live a peaceful life.

27
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,120
I, Ning Changyue,

28
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,360
always keep my word.

29
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,760
Granny and my brother also said

30
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,510
they would always stay with me.

31
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:37,190
But they still disappeared.

32
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,590
The neighbors said

33
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,030
I should cry

34
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:44,490
when the people who love me leave.

35
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,840
But I don't really know how.

36
00:02:47,410 --> 00:02:49,020
I just feel

37
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:54,079
empty inside.

38
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,910
But it also feels like something

39
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,470
has filled it up.

40
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:02,280
Have you ever felt this way?

41
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,430
If you were here,

42
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:15,310
you would definitely be able to tell her

43
00:03:15,310 --> 00:03:16,680
what this feeling is.

44
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,560
Qiu,

45
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,470
I will bring you back.

46
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:36,400
Marry him.

47
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,240
Song Yiqiu.

48
00:04:12,110 --> 00:04:14,520
You really should start a whole new life,

49
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:19,519
instead of staying with a
thousand-year-old piece of wood like me,

50
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,709
and rotting away

51
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:22,770
together.

52
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:32,780
[Live Forever]

53
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:33,720
See?

54
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:42,890
The gilt phoenix hairpin
from the Southern Tang.

55
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,650
The ice-crackle jade vase
from the Yuan Dynasty.

56
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,870
Wu School's Landscape
of the Southern Mountains

57
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,130
from the Ming Dynasty.

58
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,190
And the gold-and-silver inlaid pieces

59
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:53,950
you brought back from Persia.

60
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,850
These are the things

61
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,600
you left behind or lost over

62
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,510
the past three thousand years.

63
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,380
I found everything I could

64
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,570
and brought it all here.

65
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,820
There are also some things

66
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:10,470
I thought you might like.

67
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:13,720
The phoenix crown and ceremonial robes
of the former dynasty's empress.

68
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,250
They were far too elaborate

69
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:16,370
for everyday wear,

70
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,520
so I had them taken apart

71
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:20,190
and used the pearls
and kingfisher feathers

72
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,190
to make you a lighter set of jewelry.

73
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,920
The embroiderers here can't compare
to those in Southern Qin,

74
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,190
so I had them work overnight

75
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:30,520
to make a full set of "Hundred Sons,
Thousand Grandsons" quilts and curtains.

76
00:06:31,940 --> 00:06:34,630
Although not as exquisite
as those in the palace,

77
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:35,890
they're for good luck.

78
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,640
Oh, right.

79
00:06:38,110 --> 00:06:39,710
I bought a villa with a garden

80
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:42,159
in the best part
of the foreign concession.

81
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:43,690
The house deed and land deed

82
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:46,050
are both in the name of Song Baiwei.

83
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,950
In the garden,

84
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,920
I had a whole bed of white roses planted.

85
00:06:54,950 --> 00:06:56,240
They'll be in bloom

86
00:06:58,490 --> 00:06:59,530
by summer.

87
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:15,190
Are you switching careers

88
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:17,360
to become an antique dealer

89
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,270
or a jewelry merchant?

90
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,000
Look at all this.

91
00:07:21,450 --> 00:07:25,850
Anyone who didn't know better would think
you were preparing a betrothal gift.

92
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,420
It's not a betrothal gift.

93
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,870
It's a dowry.

94
00:07:52,250 --> 00:07:53,870
It's been thousands of years.

95
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:56,600
I haven't seen you smile
like this for a long time.

96
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,290
The life of a mortal couple

97
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,510
is only a few decades.

98
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:07,820
If you insist on tasting
this fleeting sweetness,

99
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:10,710
then I will give you
the grandest fireworks.

100
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,640
I'll make this dream of yours

101
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:17,970
lavish, dazzling,

102
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,250
and bright enough that,

103
00:08:21,550 --> 00:08:22,950
in the long years to come,

104
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,870
you can look back on this moment

105
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:30,310
and remember how happy you were.

106
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,950
But Song Baiwei,

107
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:42,260
if he makes you suffer
even the slightest wrong,

108
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:45,320
I'll make him regret ever being born.

109
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:52,120
If he can keep you smiling like this,

110
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,520
then smile to your heart's content.

111
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:06,360
Let it make up for
all these thousands of years.

112
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,510
Ning Changyue,

113
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:29,390
are you serious?

114
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,920
It's been three thousand years.

115
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:44,260
What I can give you,

116
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,720
besides this half-dead life,

117
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,840
is only these worldly possessions.

118
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:55,350
Just consider it

119
00:09:58,490 --> 00:10:01,350
a dowry from an older brother
to his younger sister.

120
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:24,010
♪ Watching time flow ♪

121
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,560
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

122
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:28,350
♪ Immortality still
cannot bring fulfillment ♪

123
00:10:28,370 --> 00:10:30,570
♪ Even if fate has destined us to part ♪

124
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,450
♪ I'll still fight with all I have ♪

125
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:35,850
♪ And cling to you with all my might ♪

126
00:10:36,130 --> 00:10:37,890
♪ I'd give up immortality ♪

127
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,720
♪ To share this joy and sorrow with you ♪

128
00:10:40,110 --> 00:10:42,510
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

129
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:48,570
♪ I'd trade this life for eternity ♪

130
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:52,260
♪ Then we'd be complete ♪

131
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,440
So these things

132
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,500
have been hidden
in your heart for so many years.

133
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,550
Now I've made you sad again.

134
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,150
Qiu.

135
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,730
Even if our red thread is severed,

136
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:28,660
I'll tie it back together.

137
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:32,600
Mr. Lin.

138
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,960
You've been looking
for me constantly lately,

139
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,440
left me so many messages,

140
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:38,630
and even came all the way here to tell me

141
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:41,160
the story behind
this marriage certificate.

142
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,510
You should keep it.

143
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,630
Consider it

144
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:46,120
fulfilling your destiny.

145
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,600
Thank you.

146
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,990
If it weren't for you,

147
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:07,450
I might never have had
the chance to find it again.

148
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:14,480
If you refuse to change, face the problem,
or deal with it,

149
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,000
of course you'll repeat the same mistakes.

150
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:24,750
Xie He.

151
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,140
Thank you for taking me in.

152
00:12:45,170 --> 00:12:47,100
I'm going to solve my problems now.

153
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,360
Thank you.

154
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,880
I'm going to find my destiny.

155
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,670
Good luck!

156
00:13:09,630 --> 00:13:10,240
Qiu.

157
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:11,960
Be home

158
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,440
at seven tonight.

159
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,880
I have something important to tell you.

160
00:14:07,710 --> 00:14:08,370
Song Yiqiu!

161
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,380
Song Yiqiu!

162
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:13,750
Song Yiqiu.

163
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:17,480
Song Yiqiu.

164
00:14:18,390 --> 00:14:19,790
Song Yiqiu, look at me.

165
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:20,600
Song Yiqiu.

166
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:23,930
Don't fall asleep.

167
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:25,550
Don't fall asleep. Wake up.

168
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,390
Look at me.

169
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,260
Song Yiqiu.

170
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,620
Song Yiqiu.

171
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,120
Don't...

172
00:14:35,390 --> 00:14:36,630
Don't call.

173
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:38,120
Don't call.

174
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,550
I won't die.

175
00:14:40,570 --> 00:14:41,570
Find...

176
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,240
Find Ning Changyue.

177
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:44,380
Find Ning...

178
00:14:45,010 --> 00:14:45,840
Find...

179
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,740
Song Yiqiu.

180
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:54,550
Song Yiqiu!

181
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:56,320
Song Yiqiu!

182
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:58,870
Song Yiqiu.

183
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:02,150
Wake up.

184
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:04,670
Song Yiqiu!

185
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:06,120
Wake up!

186
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,430
Wake up.

187
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:13,210
♪ So here is to you ♪

188
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,760
♪ My darling ♪

189
00:15:19,690 --> 00:15:22,160
♪ And here is to you ♪

190
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:26,910
♪ My friend ♪

191
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:30,690
♪ Here is to you ♪

192
00:15:31,470 --> 00:15:34,430
♪ My lover ♪

193
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:42,430
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

194
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:45,020
Hello.

195
00:15:45,580 --> 00:15:47,580
Someone is seriously injured here.

196
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,520
I'm at... I'm at...

197
00:15:52,310 --> 00:15:53,370
What are you doing?

198
00:15:53,530 --> 00:15:55,560
She's injured.
She needs to go to the hospital.

199
00:15:54,800 --> 00:16:01,800
♪ So when the fire are burning ♪

200
00:15:56,030 --> 00:15:57,120
If you don't want her wounds

201
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,720
to heal in front of everyone,

202
00:15:59,000 --> 00:15:59,840
dead one second

203
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,200
and bouncing back the next,

204
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,790
only to be taken away for experiments,

205
00:16:02,790 --> 00:16:03,960
put the phone down.

206
00:16:03,490 --> 00:16:10,760
♪ And when the light fades away ♪

207
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:17,910
♪ When the sky is falling ♪

208
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:14,200
Qiu.

209
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:25,980
♪ I'll never let you be alone ♪

210
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:27,440
Someone tried to kill me.

211
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,670
She took the knife for me.

212
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:35,600
She got hurt

213
00:16:37,510 --> 00:16:39,000
because of me.

214
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,860
If it weren't for me...

215
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,170
If it weren't for me,

216
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,770
she wouldn't...

217
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,720
That was her own choice,

218
00:17:03,260 --> 00:17:07,030
♪ So here is to you ♪

219
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:09,440
just like when she saved you
in your past life.

220
00:17:07,740 --> 00:17:11,240
♪ My darling ♪

221
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:14,880
♪ And here is to you ♪

222
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:18,099
♪ My friend ♪

223
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:23,500
♪ Here is to you ♪

224
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:21,829
What's going on?

225
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:24,000
Why isn't the wound healing?

226
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:27,060
♪ My lover ♪

227
00:17:26,550 --> 00:17:28,000
Go to the hospital now.

228
00:17:27,770 --> 00:17:37,310
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

229
00:17:41,330 --> 00:17:56,140
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

230
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:03,730
Doctor.

231
00:18:04,830 --> 00:18:06,340
The patient is in critical condition.

232
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:09,000
If the knife had been a fraction off,
she couldn't have been saved.

233
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,590
She's still in critical condition.

234
00:18:10,590 --> 00:18:12,310
Please wait outside.

235
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:25,070
Find that person.

236
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:03,180
Qiu.

237
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:06,310
Your recovery has slowed down.

238
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:09,570
Is it because the power
of immortality is fading?

239
00:19:10,530 --> 00:19:13,190
Ending immortality with you
was just an excuse.

240
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,420
I just wanted to get

241
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:16,150
the chance to stay by your side.

242
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:18,710
I got what I wanted.

243
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,030
But...

244
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:23,310
but I caused you to lie here.

245
00:19:26,410 --> 00:19:27,800
Was I wrong again?

246
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:42,250
I think I've seen
this person somewhere before.

247
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:43,920
Where was it?

248
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,400
Wu Ya.

249
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:49,930
Take good care of her.

250
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:51,130
Don't leave her side.

251
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,110
Xie He.
